---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Web Development & Website Creation | Valorferrum"
  description="Web development with Astro, WordPress and TYPO3. Performance-optimized, accessible websites with SEO foundation. For SMEs, startups and NGOs."
  lang="en"
>
  <!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-spectrum-blue/8 rounded-full blur-[120px] pulse-anim"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-80 h-80 bg-spectrum-purple/6 rounded-full blur-[100px] float-anim"></div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative">
      <div class="reveal mb-4">
        <a href="/en/services/" class="text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 group">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:-translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          All Services
        </a>
      </div>

      <h1 class="reveal font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6 leading-tight" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        Web Development
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal text-text-secondary text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
        Websites that load fast, get found on Google and work on all devices.
        Astro is my tool of choice – for everything else, we find the right solution.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== TECH-STACK ==================== -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6" aria-labelledby="stack-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 id="stack-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Astro, WordPress & Other CMS
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          No one-size-fits-all. I choose the stack based on what your project needs –
          and I master the technologies I use.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- Astro -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Astro</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            My preferred framework. Astro delivers static pages with virtually no JavaScript,
            which means: lightning-fast load times, perfect Core Web Vitals and the best SEO prerequisites.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Zero-JS-by-Default, Islands architecture</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Lighthouse-100 potential out of the box</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Ideal for marketing sites, blogs & portfolios</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- WordPress -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-blue/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">WordPress</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            If you want to maintain content yourself, WordPress is often the right choice.
            I build clean custom themes – without page-builder bloat, with a focus on performance.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Custom themes, no pre-built templates</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Performance tuning & caching setup</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Security, updates & maintenance concept</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Weitere CMS -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-pink/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Other CMS & Platforms</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Not every project fits Astro or WordPress. If needed, I also work with
            TYPO3, Jimdo or other systems – depending on what makes sense for you.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>TYPO3 for complex enterprise structures</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Jimdo & website builders (existing site evolution)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Decidim & Ruby-based platforms</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Hosting & Deployment -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-yellow/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-yellow/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-spectrum-yellow" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 12h14M5 12a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v4a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 12a2 2 0 01-2 2v4a2 2 0 012 2h14a2 2 0 012-2v-4a2 2 0 01-2-2m-2-4h.01M17 16h.01"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Hosting & Deployment</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Website built – and then? I deploy to your server, my VPS or a
            static hosting solution. Including domain, SSL and email setup.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>VPS setup, domain & DNS configuration</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>SSL certificates & email setup</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Static deploy, CDN & caching strategy</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== WHAT YOU GET ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="services-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Website Creation: What I Implement for You
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          A website is more than design. It has to be fast, get found on Google
          and work on all devices. That is the standard I deliver.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Performance -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">Performance & Core Web Vitals</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            LCP, FID, CLS – I optimize all metrics that Google evaluates for ranking and user experience. Fast is not enough, lightning-fast is the goal.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Responsive -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">Responsive Web Development</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            Mobile-First is not just a buzzword. I build websites that work just as well on smartphones as on desktop – without compromises.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- SEO-Basis -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">SEO Foundation from One Source</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            Clean URLs, correct header hierarchy, meta data, image optimization and structured data. The technical SEO foundation is included – not as an add-on.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Accessibility -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 50ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-yellow/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-yellow" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">Accessibility (WCAG)</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            High-contrast colors, keyboard navigation, semantic HTML and screen reader support. Not just for compliance, but because it affects all users.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Tracking -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 150ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">Tracking & Analytics Integration</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            Google Analytics 4, Tag Manager, conversion tracking – I build the tracking infrastructure directly into the website. No patching afterwards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Maintenance -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 250ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">Maintenance & Updates</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            Websites live. I offer ongoing maintenance: security updates, content changes, performance checks. So your website stays not just online, but current.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== WEBDEV KPIs ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-bg" aria-labelledby="kpis-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 id="kpis-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Performance Metrics & Quality Standards
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          A website is only as good as its measurable results. I optimize for concrete values,
          not gut feeling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border">
          <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">LCP</div>
          <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Largest Contentful Paint</div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">How fast is the largest visible element loaded? Google recommends under 2.5 seconds – I aim below that.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay: 50ms;">
          <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">TTFB</div>
          <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Time to First Byte</div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">How fast does the server respond? A decisive factor for perceived speed and crawling budget.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">CLS</div>
          <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Cumulative Layout Shift</div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Does the layout jump while loading? A value under 0.1 means: The page feels stable and professional.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay: 150ms;">
          <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Lighthouse</div>
          <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Audit Score</div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Google's official quality check for performance, accessibility, best practices and SEO. I target 90+ in all categories.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Bundle Size</div>
          <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">JavaScript Size</div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">How much code does the browser have to load? Less is more. Astro helps by only loading what is actually needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay: 250ms;">
          <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Crawlability</div>
          <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Indexability</div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Can Google crawl and index the page without problems? Clean URLs, correct canonicals and no blockers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== PROCESS ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface" aria-labelledby="process-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 id="process-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Web Development Process: From Idea to Launch
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          No black-box project. Every step is comprehensible, every decision documented.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="reveal flex gap-6 p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50 hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors">
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-primary/40 shrink-0 w-12">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Requirements & Concept</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
              What do you really need? I analyze your goals, target audience and content.
              From this emerges a technical concept with stack recommendation, page structure and feature list.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal flex gap-6 p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50 hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-primary/40 shrink-0 w-12">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Design & Development</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
              I develop iteratively: Wireframes, prototypes, then the finished website.
              You see progress live on a preview URL – feedback is welcome at any time.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal flex gap-6 p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50 hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-primary/40 shrink-0 w-12">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Testing, Launch & Handover</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Performance tests, cross-browser checks, mobile testing and SEO validation.
              After launch: Training, documentation and handover of all access credentials.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== CTA ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-spectrum-blue/15 via-spectrum-purple/10 to-spectrum-pink/15"></div>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center relative">
      <p class="reveal text-lg text-text-secondary mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Whether new website, relaunch or performance optimization:
        Let's find out in a free initial consultation what your project needs.
      </p>
      <div class="reveal flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        <a href="/en/contact/" class="px-8 py-4 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg shadow-primary/25 hover:shadow-primary/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0">
          Free Initial Consultation
        </a>
        <a href="/en/pricing/" class="px-8 py-4 border border-primary/30 hover:border-primary text-primary hover:text-primary-light rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-primary/5">
          Prices & Packages
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>